    "summary": "Once per battle round, this unit can do one of these:\n\n- in [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), after it has shot, if it is **unengaged**, it can move up to D6\" with a [Normal Move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move)\n- as [your opponent's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends, if it is **engaged**, it can move up to 6\" with a [Fall-Back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back)",
